ight: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Further to our conversation, for a limited time, save up to 12% on the base fare (excluding taxes, fees and surcharges) of eligible flights to Hong Kong, Singapore and the USA right up to the day of departure with no advance purchase requirements*.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To take advantage of this offer, log in and book in your&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards</a>&nbsp;account or with your preferred travel agent between 9 - 18 July 2018 for travel by 30 September 2018.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">See the table below for Qantas Business Rewards discounts.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-hei