ht="35" src="https://sslh.teradatadmc.com/qantas-sales/imgproxy/img/2012291297/QF_oneworld_footer_logo-resized.png" title="Qantas" width="167"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><hr style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 23px; margin: 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. Membership of Qantas Business Rewards and the earning of Qantas Points as a business are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions.</a></font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* Qantas Business Rewards Members must (a) book an eligible flight between 12.01AM (AEST) 9 July 2018 and 11.59pm (AEST) 18 July 2018 for travel by 30 September 2018, (b) quote registered Qantas Business Rewards ABN and Flyer's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number at the time of booking (c) book travel via Qantas Business Rewards, an IATA or TIDs registered travel agency or ticketed via an approved Ticketing Consolidator. Discounts available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards Members on eligible Economy Saver , Economy Flex, Premium Economy Saver, Premium Economy Flex, Business Saver and Business Flex fares only and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Other conditions apply. Travel agents or customers on a Corporate Deal with Qantas are not eligible for this offer.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">See full terms and conditions.</a>&nbsp;Offer ends 11:59pm 30 September 2018 unless sold out prior. Not to be used in conjunction with any other offer.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">^ Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned from air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earn Table</a>. A Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">~ You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">eligible flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable oneworld® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for details on the conditions for the applicable airline.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>